                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 351.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States</hi>. No. 2 (1882).</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Correspondence respecting the
                        imprisonment in Ireland under the “protection of person and property</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Ireland</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">act</hi>,
                    1881,” <hi rendition="#italic">of naturalized citizens of the United
                        States.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">(Presented to both Houses of Parliament by command of Her
                    Majesty. 1882.)</p>
